  "_README": [
    "Which area of law a question belongs to, and which reporting bucket that area rolls up into.",
    "Used by BOTH subjects: mahoti questions are always law-grounded; diuni questions are ~60% judgment-grounded (area comes from verdict_list.judgment_area) and ~40% law-grounded (area comes from law_areas below).",
    "Applied at READ time, so editing this file re-groups every sitting already filed as well as every future one. No regeneration, no backfill.",
    "TO MOVE AN AREA between buckets, move its string from one array to another in \"buckets\".",
    "TO RECLASSIFY A LAW, change its \"area\" in \"law_areas\". The area must appear in exactly one bucket.",
    "An area not listed in any bucket falls through and is reported under its own name, so a new area shows up as a visible gap rather than vanishing."
